-`textbegin` on a numeric label lands exactly where `layoutbegin` would.
+`textnatural` on a numeric label lands exactly where `layoutnatural` would.
 
 Set `text_direction` explicitly where the text is not self-describing — a proper
 name spelled in one script that belongs to prose running the other way.
